    {
      "path": "_i18n/en/journeys/custom-journey.md",
      "topic": "assignment_continues_and_end_policy_separate",
      "before": "Use handoff rules when the journey should stop and a person should take over the conversation.",
      "after": "Configure an assignment step when a person or team should take over the conversation. Assignment does not stop the journey by itself: it continues to the next step. If the flow should end after handoff, review its connection to the end and the end configuration. **Return to AI routing** controls what happens when the journey ends; it does not select a person or team.",
